Section C: Live theatre production

In Section C students answer one question (from a choice) on the work of theatre makers in a
single live production.

Students must have experienced live production as an audience member as part of their course.

They should be able to discuss a variety of aspects of one production giving a personal analysis
and evaluation of the theatrical elements and how successfully meaning was communicated to the
